WEBVTT

00:02:59.342 --> 00:03:03.054
who then drove him 70 miles away
for a construction project.

00:03:03.095 --> 00:03:06.140
Bernal worked from nine in the morning
until late at night.

00:03:06.849 --> 00:03:09.101
When the work was completed,

00:03:09.101 --> 00:03:10.728
his employer didn't pay him.

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:11.938
What's more,

00:03:11.938 --> 00:03:15.566
he stranded him in the parking lot
over an hour from home.

00:03:15.608 --> 00:03:16.817
The employer told him,

00:03:16.859 --> 00:03:18.653
"Tomorrow I'll come back and pay you,

00:03:18.694 --> 00:03:19.946
I didn't bring any money."

00:03:19.946 --> 00:03:21.656
When Bernal insisted on being paid,

00:03:21.697 --> 00:03:23.908
the employer relented and gave me a check.

00:03:24.242 --> 00:03:26.619
But when Bernal went to cash that check,

00:03:26.661 --> 00:03:28.079
it had no funds.

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.498
So then he was stuck
with a bounced check fee